OL,3,GNEWSAMan found shot dead in woodland
OL,4,Anamed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man found shot dead in a woodland in
OL,7,FSheffield has been named by police.
OL,9,FThe body of Ryan Kettlewell, 38, from
OL,10,FSheffield, was found in Ecclesall Woods
OL,11,Fon Wednesday.
OL,13,FIn a statement released through South
OL,14,FYorkshire Police, his family described
OL,15,Fhim as a "lovable character who will be
OL,16,Fmissed".
OL,18,FA 34-year-old woman and a 36-year-old
OL,19,Fman who were arrested in Manchester on
OL,20,FThursday on suspicion of murder have
OL,21,Fsince been bailed.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
